{"3573800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels", "steam_appid": 3573800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAFFIC RIVALS: REBORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traffic Rivals returns rebuilt with night racing, smoother performance, improved driving, smarter opponents, and a completely new progression system. Challenge other players in high-speed 1v1 duels, race with friends, or practice against AI while weaving through unpredictable traffic. Every race can begin in daylight, at sunset, or under the moon—where your headlights become your only guide through the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=1024 height=1024 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Duel Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your car, find a rival, and race head-to-head through heavy traffic.<br>Outmaneuver your opponent, create distance, and hold the lead to win.<br>Risky near misses reward skillful and aggressive driving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op &amp; Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode:</strong> Create a private room, invite friends, and join races instantly from the nearest gas station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode:</strong> Freely roam the map, practice driving, and improve your skills at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Driving Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>Standard</strong> and <strong>Drift</strong> driving modes during races.<br>Adapt to sharp turns, tight traffic, and high-speed situations in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=640 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY. WIN PARTS. SELL THEM.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cases simply by playing and leveling up. Open them to receive performance parts, wheels, and spoilers as real Steam Inventory items. Install them on your car, trade them with other players, or sell them on the Steam Community Market. Combine lower-tier parts through crafting for a chance to create rarer and more valuable upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/9b0b7593e81ee4d3ac87e77df5f003dc.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=1024 height=1024 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/9b0b7593e81ee4d3ac87e77df5f003dc.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/9b0b7593e81ee4d3ac87e77df5f003dc.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CAR. RULE THE STREETS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car with performance parts, wheels, and spoilers, then take it back onto the highway. Master standard handling, switch to Drift Mode to build multipliers and earn CR, or bring your steering wheel for a more immersive drive. Whether you race online, with friends, or against improved AI, every part you earn brings your car one step closer to becoming a street legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/8cb9a2d22c9d0977d34ab1f7b847e898.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=1024 height=1024 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/8cb9a2d22c9d0977d34ab1f7b847e898.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/8cb9a2d22c9d0977d34ab1f7b847e898.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRING YOUR WHEEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the highway with support for 29 steering wheel profiles from Logitech, Thrustmaster, Fanatec, and Moza. Plug in and drive, calibrate your wheel, pedals, and handbrake, and experience H-pattern shifting with a clutch that can even stall the engine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NIGHT HAS FALLEN. THE RIVALRY HAS BEEN REBORN.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAFFIC RIVALS: REBORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traffic Rivals returns rebuilt with night racing, smoother performance, improved driving, smarter opponents, and a completely new progression system. Challenge other players in high-speed 1v1 duels, race with friends, or practice against AI while weaving through unpredictable traffic. Every race can begin in daylight, at sunset, or under the moon—where your headlights become your only guide through the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=1024 height=1024 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/466575a5a7a7b9d0c84cf24d3c64c9c1.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Duel Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your car, find a rival, and race head-to-head through heavy traffic.<br>Outmaneuver your opponent, create distance, and hold the lead to win.<br>Risky near misses reward skillful and aggressive driving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op &amp; Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode:</strong> Create a private room, invite friends, and join races instantly from the nearest gas station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode:</strong> Freely roam the map, practice driving, and improve your skills at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Driving Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>Standard</strong> and <strong>Drift</strong> driving modes during races.<br>Adapt to sharp turns, tight traffic, and high-speed situations in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.poster.avif?t=1787585615\" width=640 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.webm?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY. WIN PARTS. SELL THEM.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cases