m_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/8cb9a2d22c9d0977d34ab1f7b847e898.mp4?t=1787585615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRING YOUR WHEEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the highway with support for 29 steering wheel profiles from Logitech, Thrustmaster, Fanatec, and Moza. Plug in and drive, calibrate your wheel, pedals, and handbrake, and experience H-pattern shifting with a clutch that can even stall the engine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE NIGHT HAS FALLEN. THE RIVALRY HAS BEEN REBORN.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels is an action-packed street racing game where you skillfully weave through heavy traffic in intense 1v1 duels. Outsmart rivals with strategy and skill, customize your car, and become a street legend solo or with friends in co-op mode!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Turkish, Greek, Czech, Finnish, Danish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/0911b30db44c8cf1dd4d14e989d3f2d29c9c577b/header.jpg?t=1787585615", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/8c367d2b3c9a79afe0fe233ceb9778c135721a52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787585615", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/8c367d2b3c9a79afe0fe233ceb9778c135721a52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787585615", "website": "https://cubesync.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 8700k / AMD 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 ti, RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ver